B.Jf=s(["I published my novels anonymously during my lifetime.","Most of my stories focus on family, marriage and social class.","I wrote a novel featuring Anne Elliot.","I created the Dashwood sisters.","One of my novels centres on Emma Woodhouse.","I wrote Sense and Sensibility.","Mr Darcy is one of my most famous characters.","I wrote Pride and Prejudice.","I was an English novelist of the Regency era.","My first name is Jane."],t.s)
